# ============================================================
# Git ignore rules for claude-vibe-coding
# 注释必须独占一行；行内 # 注释会破坏 pattern 匹配
# ============================================================

# --- 操作系统冗余 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp

# --- IDE / 编辑器 ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml

# --- 截图（自动生成的测试产物，每次跑测试都覆盖）---
**/screenshots/
test_screenshots/
**/screen.png
001/snake-screenshot-v2.png

# --- 临时工作目录（TEMP.* 前缀通常是早期试验品）---
001.雅思阅读/TEMP.*/

# --- 压缩包（源码包 / 下载源，已解包到同名目录）---
*.zip

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg-info/

# --- Node ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-store/

# --- 临时 / 日志 / 备份 ---
*.tmp
*.temp
*.log
*.bak

# --- 系统 ---
.DS_Store
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
